OL,3,AUK and Germany will face threats
OL,4,Atogether, says Burnham in Berlin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK and Germany will face threats
OL,7,Ftogether, Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,8,Fhas said as he announced a series of
OL,9,Fdefence and security partnerships.
OL,11,FOn his first official European trip
OL,12,Foutside of Ukraine, Burnham was greeted
OL,13,Fwith military honours in Berlin on
OL,14,FThursday and met German Chancellor
OL,15,FFriedrich Merz.
OL,17,FSpeaking to reporters at the German
OL,18,Fcapital's Federal Chancellery, the PM
OL,19,Fsaid both countries were facing hybrid
OL,20,Fattacks "on a regular basis" and "it
OL,21,Fmakes sense" to take them on together.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
